meta {
  name: create checkout
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

post {
  url: https://tofu-dubbing-api.dolishco.com/api/subscriptions/create-checkout-session
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "planInterval": "monthly"
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Create Checkout Session
  
  Create a Stripe checkout session for subscription payment.
  
  ## Endpoint
  POST /api/subscriptions/create-checkout-session
  
  ## Authentication
  **Required** - Must include Bearer token in Authorization header
  
  ## Request Body
  ```json
  {
    "planInterval": "monthly"
  }
  ```
  
  - `planInterval`: Must be either "monthly" or "yearly"
  
  ## Description
  Creates a Stripe checkout session for users to subscribe to Pro plan.
  Supports both monthly and yearly billing intervals.
  
  ## Response (201 Created)
  ```json
  {
    "url": "https://checkout.stripe.com/c/pay/cs_live_..."
  }
  ```
  
  - `url`: Stripe checkout page URL to redirect user to
  
  ## Error Responses
  - **400 Bad Request**: 
    - `{ "message": "alreadyHaveSubscription" }` - User already has an active subscription
    - Invalid planInterval value
  - **401 Unauthorized**: Missing or invalid token
  
  ## Business Logic
  - Checks if user already has active subscription (status: active/trialing, currentPeriodEnd >= now)
  - If active subscription exists, returns error
  - Creates Stripe checkout session with user's email
  - Stores userId in session's client_reference_id
  - Success URL includes session_id parameter
  
  ## Use Cases
  - User wants to upgrade to Pro account
  - Select billing plan (monthly/yearly)
  - Initiate payment process
}

